.TH "PACE AUTH" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace auth Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-auth \- Authentication and token management.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace auth
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Authentication and token management.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBlogin\fP
  Authenticate with Garmin Connect (uses...
  See \fBpace auth-login(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBlogin\fP command.
.PP
\fBstatus\fP
  Show whether cached tokens exist.
  See \fBpace auth-status(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBstatus\fP command.
.PP
\fBlogout\fP
  Delete cached tokens.
  See \fBpace auth-logout(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBlogout\fP command.
